    "Name": "Partisan AAA (CC)",
    "Details": "The Partisan Air Defense Tank (Company Command) is a significant upgrade designed to engage and destroy Clan fighters. The older ICE was replaced by a fusion engine. Its armor was upgraded to Ferro-Fibrous, drastically increasing its protection. A C3 Master Unit provides for better coordination with the rest of its unit, increasing accuracy. Finally, its weapons complement was replaced with twin LBX-10 class autocannons with ample ammunition.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 3/5 hexes / 90/150 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       175     40\n<b>Left</b>         130     40\n<b>Right</b>       130     40\n<b>Rear</b>        105     40\n<b>Turret</b>      175     40\n\n<b>Total</b>      715    200</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Anti-Air Targeting</color>",
    "Icon": "Partisan"
  },
